codex
The reverse opaque fold is not being selected during implication checking, so I’m removing that indirection. With the two actual causes now fixed—disjoint `finishRel` equations and folded `neighborMin`—the clean postcondition is the exact recursive relation itself. I’m stating that same `finishRel(empty, output, floor(k/2), neighbor, k)` in `result-tail`, `result-finish`, and the full target so composition is syntactically direct.
apply patch
